From 54f685ad3b1ae0cb347fac47fb124c563012d02c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Levitte <levitte@openssl.foundation>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:07:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] providers/implementations/signature/build.info: fix goal for
 slh_dsa_sig.c

slh_dsa_sig.c was misassigned to DSA_GOAL instead of SLH_DSA_GOAL.
No real impact now, but will have an impact whenever DSA may be moved.

Fixes: 2f9e152d86a7 "Add SLH_DSA signature verification."
Reviewed-by: Eugene Syromiatnikov <esyr@openssl.org>
Reviewed-by: Nikola Pajkovsky <nikolap@openssl.org>
Merge-date: Tue Nov 10 12:15:59 2026
Merged-from: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/33587
(cherry picked from commit b4676b7363df683db2bc8838984acff0a1d6d83a)
---
 providers/implementations/signature/build.info | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/providers/implementations/signature/build.info b/providers/implementations/signature/build.info
index 0fd39841f340..253a7235e073 100644
--- a/providers/implementations/signature/build.info
+++ b/providers/implementations/signature/build.info
@@ -41,5 +41,5 @@ IF[{- !$disabled{'ml-dsa'} -}]
 ENDIF
 
 IF[{- !$disabled{'slh-dsa'} -}]
-  SOURCE[$DSA_GOAL]=slh_dsa_sig.c
+  SOURCE[$SLH_DSA_GOAL]=slh_dsa_sig.c
 ENDIF
